{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_093_1000_p", "source_sha256": "618c30d4f9c9376a60cbce94cd80c2ce2801fbb28853eb0e43fac787fccabf91", "ja": "歩、お疲れさま！\nブログにステージの感想、たくさん来てるよ。", "zh": "小步，辛苦了！\n博客上收到了很多对舞台的感想哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_093_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e98b5b1692b1a49a51179b4f3cd1f6da1308fe8f89feb1c74ffcea3c836d296f", "ja": "そうなんだよ！　なんか、兄貴のSNSにも、\nアタシのステージの感想が届いてるんだって。", "zh": "就是啊！听说我哥哥的社交账号上，也收到了不少对我舞台表演的感想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_093_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "96cb34d67bcbee21bd8255a39c1e1e6156fb38e9efb0c5cefc71c282498de58b", "ja": "それ見て、「お前には負けてられない！」って……\nいい刺激になったって、言ってたよ。", "zh": "他看了之后还说：“我可不能输给你！”……这对他来说是个很好的刺激。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_093_1003_p", "source_sha256": "e927dab404f29634646aabd996ec43ca6d3382743e2490633443d60d7e74b09b", "ja": "相乗効果ってやつだな。お互い、\nいい影響があったみたいで、良かったじゃないか。", "zh": "这就是所谓的相互促进吧。看来彼此都受到了不错的影响，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_093_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ab9c0ef73cfe4d5b423debc54e5609c8a28a83b13c8d656a7be88009ac871534", "ja": "へへっ、まあね！　……それにしても兄貴、\nもうすこしわかりやすく言ってくれないかな～？", "zh": "嘿嘿，算是吧！……话说回来，大哥，你就不能说得再直白一点吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_093_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9a418792ffd9be25517cf959b42105b1d092b9d418292803023c1295dd48a61d", "ja": "そうしたらアタシも、変に悩まなくて済んだのに！\n実力を認められたのはうれしいけど、複雑だよ～！", "zh": "要是那样的话，我也就不用莫名其妙地烦恼了啊！\n虽然能得到实力上的认可让我很开心，可心情还是很复杂啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_093_1006_p", "source_sha256": "efeef85f77e119866ce43c6b04b573421a85730f8b067d6ca47045eb32eaa744", "ja": "まあまあ……そういえば、\nお兄さんは明日帰国するんだっけ？", "zh": "好啦好啦……说起来，\n你哥哥明天要回国来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_093_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "57ea5e4fe99f80f59dc29e3173d04a009a7e0933b43ec170b26a3e099760739b", "ja": "うん、そうらしいよ。戻ったらすぐ仕事だって。\nホント、忙しそうでさ……♪", "zh": "嗯，好像是这样。听说回去后马上就要工作了。\n真的，看起来好忙啊……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_093_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ad6e9fa3268a8f4e86410a5ce2d018f20bdcc1a449394dc88f4ae841357698b4", "ja": "あれ？　噂をすれば兄貴から電話が……もしもし？\nうん……えっ、何しに来たの！？", "zh": "咦？说曹操曹操到，哥哥打电话来了……喂？\n嗯……诶，你来干什么啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_093_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "dc2212bf88fb64bac7200687267ec2afa16dd06fec45c8b984263b1e35f4a792", "ja": "劇場にって……いいから、来なくて！　アタシが\n駅まで行くから、ちょっと待ってて！　それじゃ！", "zh": "说要来剧场……总之你别来了！我去车站接你，等我一会儿！那就这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_093_1011_se", "source_sha256": "fd993b14b145e58f1e3c4874d81717a825f3dbff8275d4420c4679afe2850b3b", "ja": "プツッ、ツーッ、ツーッ", "zh": "咔、嘟——、嘟——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_093_1012_p", "source_sha256": "6649957482fe4b7ae97a720279d45f1ae0eda0efb0a762ae146bc32535813406", "ja": "歩？　どうしたんだ、そんなに慌てて……。", "zh": "步？怎么了，慌慌张张的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_093_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0236262cdeb8093acc57c0a904499fa3d972d90048bd5aa97b189d4f6e615229", "ja": "……なんか、兄貴を見送りに、お父さんと\nお母さんがこっちに来てるらしくて……。", "zh": "……好像是我爸和我妈\n为了送我哥，特意来这边了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_093_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5194a59676194cfdbc463ff6d65ac384e01bf5d604ec5fdd9ba43c8c9a655bf4", "ja": "せっかくだから、\n劇場にも来るとか言ってるんだよ～！", "zh": "难得他们还说要来剧场看看呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_093_1015_p", "source_sha256": "fd4bbb9044cbd811b6698e784ae122201bd07db4b6df79ae92a198c512613735", "ja": "そうなのか？　なら、ちょうどいいな。\n俺もご両親にご挨拶を……。", "zh": "是这样吗？那正好。\n我也去拜访一下你的父母……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
